spans.s:
शब॑ल a. variegated, brindled;
 mingled or joined with
(—˚);
 altered, disfigured. m. N. of a serpent-demon;
 f. शबली॑ the
Wonder-cow (myth.).

शाब्द॑ f. ई relating to sounds or words, esp. based upon
the sacred word i.e. the Veda;
 m. philologist, grammarian.

शब्दवेध m. the shooting at the mere sound (without
seeing the aim);
 adj. ˚धिन्, abstr. ˚धित्व n.

शब्दार्थ m. the meaning of sounds or of a word;
 du.
word and sense.

शाब्दिक a. uttering a sound or familiar with sounds
(words);
 m. = prec. m.

सबन्धु a. being of the same family, related;
 having a
relative or friend.

सबाह्यान्तःकरण a. with the external and
internal organs;
 w. आत्मन् m. the whole self.
